      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dyke%2C_Virginia",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Estes Farm, a historic homestead near Dyke, was added to the National Register of Historic Places in 2006.",
